# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Silent Co-Driver — .gitignore
# Read docs/GIT_WORKFLOW.md before changing this file.
# Rule: if a file is machine-generated or >5 MB, it belongs here.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ── Node / Next.js ───────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.next/
out/
.turbo/
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
.vercel/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ── Secrets & local config ───────────────────────────────────
# NEVER commit these. Commit the .example files instead.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
backend/.env
frontend/.env.local
!*.example

# ── FastF1 cache (regenerable, hundreds of MB) ───────────────
# Anyone can rebuild this by running scripts/fetch_laps.py
backend/.fastf1_cache/
.fastf1_cache/
cache/

# ── HuggingFace model weights (GBs — never commit) ───────────
# Cached to ~/.cache/huggingface by default; this covers a local override.
.hf_cache/
models/
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.onnx

# ── Raw / intermediate audio (see docs/DATASET.md) ───────────
# We COMMIT the final 16 kHz mono WAV clips in data/clips/ (~10 MB total)
# because the demo must work on a fresh clone with zero setup.
# We do NOT commit the raw downloads they were cut from.
data/raw/
data/tmp/
f1_radio_clips/
*.mp4
*.mkv
*.webm
*.m4a
*.part
*.ytdl

# Uploads made through the live /api/analyze path at runtime
backend/data/uploads/
data/uploads/

# ── OS / editor noise ────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/extensions.json

# ── Claude Code local state ──────────────────────────────────
.claude/settings.local.json

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# EXPLICITLY TRACKED (do not add these to the ignore list)
#   data/clips/*.wav        — the demo dataset, ~10 MB, must survive a clone
#   data/metadata.csv       — clip → driver/race/lap mapping
#   data/labels.csv         — hand labels for the eval set
#   data/laps/*.json        — FastF1 dumps, small, so the demo works offline
#   data/cache/analyses.json— precomputed model output, powers the demo
#   docs/*.md               — planning docs (see note in GIT_WORKFLOW.md
#                             about untracking these after the hackathon)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Planning docs
docs/
*.md
!README.md
*.txt
*.docx
